WEBVTT

00:04:59.756 --> 00:05:03.676
Is it really OK that websites
that are recently built

00:05:03.716 --> 00:05:06.956
are still inaccessible
for disabled people?

00:05:06.996 --> 00:05:09.156
If not now, when?

00:05:10.596 --> 00:05:14.596
OK, so what does accessible
web design actually mean?

00:05:15.556 --> 00:05:17.756
Please take a look at these doors.

00:05:17.796 --> 00:05:20.196
They both go into the same building.

00:05:20.196 --> 00:05:23.116
Both sets of doors have level access.

00:05:23.116 --> 00:05:26.916
The door on the left slides open
automatically as you approach it.

00:05:27.756 --> 00:05:29.916
The doors on the right
have to be pulled open.